/E (This chapter demonstrates the CPSS operating end-to-end on a specific statutory problem: the NPPF Paragraph 11\(d\) "tilted balance." When a Local Authority cannot demonstrate a 5-year housing land supply, Paragraph 11\(d\) forces planning officers to apply a presumption in favour of sustainable development, suspending local democratic plans. The CPSS engine operationalises Footnote 7 of Paragraph 11\(d\)\(i\), which legally disarms the tilted balance when specific protected assets are present.)
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [1]
>>
