3557 0 obj
<<
/Title (This chapter documents the federated software architecture executing 33 parallel asynchronous HTTP requests against 65+ live open-government spatial layers. A key technical challenge is the coordinate projection gap: statutory UK environmental constraints are natively indexed in British National Grid \(EPSG:27700\), whereas standard web APIs output WGS84 \(EPSG:4326\). Passing WGS84 coordinates directly into a statutory endpoint casts query points into the Atlantic Ocean, producing false negatives across the entire cohort. An in-memory geodetic engine was built in pure TypeScript to resolve this.)
/Dest [19 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2380 0 R
/First 3874 0 R
/Last 3875 0 R
/Count -11
/Next 3876 0 R
>>
endobj
